# Dataset binaries never go in git: the full store is ~8.7 GB and the raw
# archives ~25 GB, both far past GitHub's 1 GB free LFS quota -- and `git lfs
# pull` needs internet, which Snowflake does not have. Code ships by git,
# data ships by Snowflake stage (btcpred.data.stage). The 3-day smoke sample
# lives in data/sample/bars_3d.npz as an ordinary 2.4 MB blob.
data/bars_1s/
data/raw/
dist/
artifacts/
